sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Building and querying an ontology
    accDescr: The caller registers a type, writes nodes, trains NEL, then parses a query. Parse-tree calls NEL during training and during parsing.
    autonumber
    participant You
    participant PT as parse-tree :8093
    participant NEL as NEL :8092
    You->>PT: POST /ontology/types
    You->>PT: POST /ontology/data (nodes)
    You->>PT: POST /ner/train
    PT->>NEL: upsert each node's aliases
    You->>PT: POST /extract/relations {"user_query": ...}
    PT->>NEL: extract and link
    PT-->>You: NLOutput tree
